  "courseSlug": "react-native-the-practical-guide",
  "courseTitle": "React Native - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197442",
      "title": "Handling Errors",
      "lectureOrder": 40,
      "videoOrder": 37,
      "sourceHash": "db714b48854f303589c1c2360b7d4f2f35835e22870932202161258f03392602",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.48,
          "end": 4.19,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] Now, let's start this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.19,
          "end": 6.44,
          "en": "by exploring error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.44,
          "end": 10.1,
          "en": "And at the moment this app has no error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.1,
          "end": 11.88,
          "en": "but we can force one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.88,
          "end": 15.38,
          "en": "Tor this I'll go to the GoalInput.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.38,
          "end": 19.78,
          "en": "and in there, I will simply force an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.78,
          "end": 23.72,
          "en": "by actually setting this image source",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.72,
          "end": 25.73,
          "en": "not to the correct source.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.73,
          "end": 27.23,
          "en": "I will comment this out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.23,
          "end": 31.7,
          "en": "Instead, I will set the source to just a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.7,
          "end": 34.55,
          "en": "some path to image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.55,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "Now this path doesn't exist, but this doesn't matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.89,
          "end": 41.993,
          "en": "because that's also not a good way of defining such a path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.37,
          "end": 47.18,
          "en": "If I save this, we now get an error here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.18,
          "end": 50.76,
          "en": "when we have a look at our emulators at the bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.76,
          "end": 54.42,
          "en": "and we also get one here in the terminal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.42,
          "end": 56.6,
          "en": "And the error message we're getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.6,
          "end": 60.16,
          "en": "is that we provided an invalid prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.16,
          "end": 63.26,
          "en": "to be precise that the source prop is the problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.26,
          "end": 68.26,
          "en": "to the image, and that it expected one of type number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.62,
          "end": 69.78999999999999,
          "en": "Now I will be honest.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.78999999999999,
          "end": 74.72,
          "en": "This last part is a bit confusing and you will often have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.72,
          "end": 79.72,
          "en": "confusing elements in error messages, they are not perfect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.11,
          "end": 81.7,
          "en": "But what is important is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.7,
          "end": 84.3,
          "en": "you read the message because often it gives you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.3,
          "end": 88.53999999999999,
          "en": "a first hint at what's wrong and what could be the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.53999999999999,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "Here the hint is relatively clear that it is related",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 94.47999999999999,
          "en": "to the source prop of the image component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.47999999999999,
          "end": 96.68,
          "en": "But even if it's a bit more abstract,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.68,
          "end": 98.5,
          "en": "you might at least get a first idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.5,
          "end": 100.92,
          "en": "of where to look for the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.92,
          "end": 102.953,
          "en": "and where you could maybe fix it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 106.45,
          "en": "Now, in addition, what's also very useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.45,
          "end": 110.84,
          "en": "when getting error messages, is this stack trace down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.84,
          "end": 114.22,
          "en": "This tells you where the error occurred.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.22,
          "end": 117.49000000000001,
          "en": "The first line isn't too useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.49000000000001,
          "end": 119.59,
          "en": "because here it points at an image component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.59,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "in some weird path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "because that in the end is the bundled code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 125.34,
          "en": "to which it's pointing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.34,
          "end": 127.52,
          "en": "and that's not helping us too much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.52,
          "end": 129.86,
          "en": "But if you have a look at the parts down here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.86,
          "end": 131.47,
          "en": "it becomes more useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.47,
          "end": 135.34,
          "en": "Here we learn that it's in the GoalInput component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.34,
          "end": 138.11,
          "en": "which is created by the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.11,
          "end": 140.55,
          "en": "This can be useful if you have the same component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.55,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "being used in multiple components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 145.04,
          "en": "then you know which instance being used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.04,
          "end": 147.93,
          "en": "by which other component is causing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.93,
          "end": 149.69,
          "en": "And therefore now it's pretty clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.69,
          "end": 152.54,
          "en": "that we should dive into the GoalInput component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.54,
          "end": 155.12,
          "en": "and that in there we might wanna look for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.12,
          "end": 157.31,
          "en": "the users of the image component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.31,
          "end": 159.803,
          "en": "and then take a closer look at the source prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.66,
          "end": 164.32999999999998,
          "en": "And if we're not sure of what should be provided here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.32999999999998,
          "end": 167.46,
          "en": "then of course it's always a good idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.46,
          "end": 170.15,
          "en": "to look into the official documentation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.15,
          "end": 172.25,
          "en": "If you search for react native image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.25,
          "end": 173.91,
          "en": "you should get a direct link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.91,
          "end": 177.06,
          "en": "to the official documentation for this image component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.06,
          "end": 181.06,
          "en": "But you can also just go to the React Native main page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.06,
          "end": 185.26,
          "en": "and then to Components, and then find the image there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.26,
          "end": 186.95,
          "en": "And here you then learn more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.95,
          "end": 188.96,
          "en": "about the usage of this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.96,
          "end": 193.093,
          "en": "and which kind of value can be passed to the source prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.21,
          "end": 196.56,
          "en": "Now, here we forced this error, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.56,
          "end": 198.82999999999998,
          "en": "So it is rather simple to fix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.82999999999998,
          "end": 200.57,
          "en": "but I wanted to show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.57,
          "end": 203.53,
          "en": "what you can make of such error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.53,
          "end": 206.23,
          "en": "And before I save this fixed code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 206.23,
          "end": 210.19,
          "en": "let's also have a closer look at the emulator again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 210.19,
          "end": 213.37,
          "en": "There, we also got a error message at the bottom here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.37,
          "end": 215.16,
          "en": "And you will sometimes get warnings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.16,
          "end": 216.68,
          "en": "or error messages down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216.68,
          "end": 220,
          "en": "and you can click on them to see more details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220,
          "end": 222.6,
          "en": "Indeed, you see that here it's actually not an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.6,
          "end": 224.41,
          "en": "but a warning, which means,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.41,
          "end": 227.81,
          "en": "yeah, the app still runs but not as intended,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.81,
          "end": 230.45,
          "en": "in this case no image would be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.45,
          "end": 233.14,
          "en": "and you get a similar output as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 233.14,
          "end": 235.57,
          "en": "You get basically the same error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 235.57,
          "end": 237.88,
          "en": "or warning message up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.88,
          "end": 240.49,
          "en": "And then you got a stack trace down here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 240.49,
          "end": 243.15,
          "en": "though I will say that this output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 243.15,
          "end": 246.85,
          "en": "is not that useful compared to what we had",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 246.85,
          "end": 248.44,
          "en": "here in the terminal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 248.44,
          "end": 251.96,
          "en": "Here in the terminal it was pretty clear pretty quickly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 251.96,
          "end": 254.3,
          "en": "which component, the image component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 254.3,
          "end": 257.5,
          "en": "in which component built by us causes the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 257.5,
          "end": 260.49,
          "en": "Here it's not immediately clear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 262.06,
          "en": "Nonetheless, taking a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 262.06,
          "end": 263.91,
          "en": "at this output can also be helpful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 263.91,
          "end": 265.43,
          "en": "At least here we also learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 265.43,
          "end": 267.33299999999997,
          "en": "that it is related to an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 268.33,
          "end": 271.73,
          "en": "Now with that I will of course save the fixed code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 271.73,
          "end": 275.663,
          "en": "And with that, the apps update and the error goes away.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
